        {
          "text": "Dena ifuku odu ambanda atanu nayedi akakwata iyala wumu, nawu, Tukudidiishaŋa etu aweni, tukudivwikaŋa etu aweni, kumina dakututenena kwejina deyi hohu, wutufumishi kusawuka.",
          "type": "text",
