              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dena ifuku odu mutayi waYehova wakekala walubanji ni kulema, ninyikabu yamwituŋa yakekala yawanta nilubanji, nanawa apulukili muIsarela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakelayi Mwanta naweleshi dehi anyana awambanda amuZiyona, majilu awu anafumi dehi, natookeshumu dehi mashi adiŋi muYerusalema, naspiritu yakusompesha ninaspiritu yakwocha nawa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.4.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 4:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "dihu hakelawuniyena ashiyiluwu muZiyona, niyena washeli muYerusalema, hiyakayitenanawu ajila, wowu ejima asonekeluwu hamu nawamomi muYerusalema. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.4.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hewulu damatala ejima ahampidi yaZiyona, nihewulu dayipompelu yindi, Yehova wakaleŋclahu ivu nawishi namwa ana, nikutoŋae ka kwakesikamuzuzu nawufuku, kulonda hewulu dakulema kwejima hakekali hakubuta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.4.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakekala chisolu chawulelu namwa ana kuchina nkanza, kulonda kwikali kwakubatama, nikwakweyama mpepela yasweja kuzuwa ninvula nawa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.4.6",
